// Original code for RetroPixels (PixelU-Wii). Not derived from Dolphin.

// The Vulkan entry points the backend uses, as an X-macro list. Each row is
// RP_VK_<scope>_FN(entry point, must exist); a file defines the scope macros it needs and
// includes this list. The rows are in load order, which is also the order of the
// vkGetInstanceProcAddr / vkGetDeviceProcAddr lookups at start-up.
//   MODULE:   exported by the loader library itself
//   INSTANCE: looked up per VkInstance
//   DEVICE:   looked up per VkDevice


